lain \li0 \ri0 \lisb0 \lisa0 \nowidctlpar \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \dbch \af1 \hich \af3 \loch \af3 \cf1 {\fs24 \dbch \af5 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1  \uc1 \u160 ? \uc1 \u160 ?Now I do not think software}{\fs24 \dbch \af6 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 \ul1  \uc1 \u160 ?72 \uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \dbch \af5 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 have less inherent courage and firmness than chefs\dbch \f5 {\uc1 \u65292 ?}nor than other engineering managers{\uc1 \u65294 ?}But false}{\fs24 \dbch \af6 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 \ul1  \uc1 \u160 ?73 \uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \dbch \af5 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 to match the patron's desired date is much more common in our discipline than elsewhere in engineering\dbch \f5 {\uc1 \u65294 ?}It is very}{\fs24 \dbch \af6 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 \ul1  \uc1 \u160 ?74 \uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \dbch \af5 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 to make a vigorous\dbch \f5 {\uc1 \u65292 ?}plausible{\uc1 \u65292 ?}and job risking defense of an estimate that is derived by no quantitative method{\uc1 \u65292 ?}supported by little data{\uc1 \u65292 ?}and certified chiefly by the hunches of the managers{\uc1 \u65294 ?} }{\fs24 \dbch \af5 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 \par }\pard \plain \li0 \ri0 \lisb0 \lisa0 \nowidctlpar \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \dbch \af1 \hich \af3 \loch \af3 \cf1 {\fs24 \dbch \af5 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1  \uc1 \u160 ? \uc1 \u160 ?Clearly two solutions are needed\dbch \f5 {\uc1 \u65294 ?}We need to develop and publicize productivity figures{\uc1 \u65292 ?}bug-incidence figures{\uc1 \u65292 ?}estimating rules{\uc1 \u65292 ?}and so on{\uc1 \u65294 ?}The whole profession can only profit from}{\fs24 \dbch \af6 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 \ul1  \uc1 \u160 ?75 \uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \dbch \af5 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 such data\dbch \f5 {\uc1 \u65294 ?}Until estimating is on a sounder basis{\uc1 \u65292 ?}individual managers will need to stiffen their backbones and defend their estimates with the assurance that their poor hunches are better than wish derived estimates{\uc1 \u65294 ?} }{\fs24 \dbch \af5 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 \par }\pard \plain \li0 \ri0 \lisb0 \lisa0 \nowidctlpar \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \dbch \af1 \hich \af3 \loch \af3 \cf1 {\fs24 \dbch \af5 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 71\dbch \f5 {\uc1 \u12289 ?}A{\uc1 \u65294 ?}no \uc1 \u160 ? \uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \loch \af4 \hich \af4 \dbch \f1 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \cf1       }{\fs24 \dbch \af5 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 B\dbch \f5 {\uc1 \u65294 ?}the same  \uc1 \u160 ? \uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \loch \af4 \hich \af4 \dbch \f1 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \cf1      }{\fs24 \dbch \af5 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 C\dbch \f5 {\uc1 \u65294 ?}other \uc1 \u160 ? \uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \loch \af4 \hich \af4 \dbch \f1 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \cf1    }{\fs24 \dbch \af5 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 D\dbch \f5 {\uc1 \u65294 ?}lots of}{\fs24 \dbch \af5 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 \par }\pard \plain \li0 \ri0 \lisb0 \lisa0 \nowidctlpar \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \dbch \af1 \hich \af3 \loch \af3 \cf1 {\fs24 \dbch \af5 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 72\dbch \f5 {\uc1 \u12289 ?}A{\uc1 \u65294 ?}testers \uc1 \u160 ? \uc1 \u160 ?B{\uc1 \u65294 ?}constructors  \uc1 \u160 ? \uc1 \u160 ?C{\uc1 \u65294 ?}managers \uc1 \u160 ? \uc1 \u160 ?D{\uc1 \u65294 ?}architects}{\fs24 \dbch \af5 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 \par }\pard \plain \li0 \ri0 \lisb0 \lisa0 \nowidctlpar \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \dbch \af1 \hich \af3 \loch \af3 \cf1 {\fs24 \dbch \af5 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 73\dbch \f5 {\uc1 \u12289 ?}A{\uc1 \u65294 ?}tasks \uc1 \u160 ? \uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \loch \af4 \hich \af4 \dbch \f1 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \cf1   }{\fs24 \dbch \af5 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 B\dbch \f5 {\uc1 \u65294 ?}jobs  \uc1 \u160 ? \uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \loch \af4 \hich \af4 \dbch \f1 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \cf1         }{\fs24 \dbch \af5 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \cf1 C\dbch \f5 {\uc1 \u65294 ?}works \uc1 \u160 ? \uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \loch \af4 \hi